sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Користувач
  participant App as app.js
  participant Sys as LinearSystem
  participant An as analysis.js
  participant G as GaussSolver
  participant It as Jacobi / Seidel
  participant Ch as Chart
  participant P as Player
  participant V as MatrixView
  U->>App: кнопка «n = 20»
  App->>Sys: fromVariant(20, d)
  Sys-->>App: system
  App->>App: readOptions(), checkDominance(A)
  App->>An: solveAll(system, options)
  An->>G: solve(system)
  G-->>An: x або SingularMatrixError
  alt матриця невироджена
    loop для Якобі та Зейделя
      An->>It: solve(system, record)
      It->>Sys: residualNorm(x)
      It-->>An: x, iterations, residuals, history
    end
  end
  An-->>App: results (метрики, час)
  App->>Ch: setSeries(розв’язки, нев’язки)
  Ch->>Ch: seriesBounds(), draw()
  App->>G: solve(system, record)
  G-->>App: steps
  App->>P: load(steps.length)
  U->>App: «Пуск»
  App->>P: toggle()
  loop кожен кадр
    P->>App: showFrame(index)
    App->>V: show(steps[index])
  end
